  "summary": {
    "en": "A line per series over time, on an SVG with receding gridlines and labels at the line ends. For trends across many points; at most four series, the second one dashed.",
    "id": "Satu garis per seri sepanjang waktu, pada SVG dengan garis grid yang samar dan label di ujung garis. Untuk tren dengan banyak titik; paling banyak empat seri, seri kedua putus-putus."
  },
  "titleId": "Line chart",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Two series with a crosshair",
        "desc": "Move the pointer over the plot: a crosshair snaps to the nearest week and the tip shows both values. The labels at the ends make the legend optional.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Is our service on par with other puskesmas?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Patient satisfaction score per week, this puskesmas against the city average</div></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-1); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>This puskesmas</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>City average</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; padding-top: 44px;\" data-pts='[[62,64],[68,66],[65,67],[71,68],[74,70],[70,69],[78,72],[81,73],[79,74],[84,75]]' onmousemove=\"const r = this.getBoundingClientRect(), d = JSON.parse(this.dataset.pts), n = d.length - 1; const i = Math.max(0, Math.min(n, Math.round(((event.clientX - r.left) / r.width * 1000 - 44) / (856 / n)))); const x = 44 + i * 856 / n, y = (v) => 232 - (v - 50) / 40 * 220, s = this.querySelector('svg'); s.querySelector('[data-cross]').setAttribute('x1', x); s.querySelector('[data-cross]').setAttribute('x2', x); s.querySelector('[data-p1]').setAttribute('cx', x); s.querySelector('[data-p1]').setAttribute('cy', y(d[i][0])); s.querySelector('[data-p2]').setAttribute('cx', x); s.querySelector('[data-p2]').setAttribute('cy', y(d[i][1])); s.querySelectorAll('[data-hover]').forEach((e) => e.style.opacity = 1); const t = this.querySelector('.ctip'); t.textContent = 'Week ' + (i + 1) + ': this puskesmas ' + d[i][0] + ', city average ' + d[i][1]; t.style.opacity = 1; t.style.left = Math.max(0, Math.min(r.width - t.offsetWidth, x / 1000 * r.width - t.offsetWidth / 2)) + 'px';\" onmouseleave=\"this.querySelector('.ctip').style.opacity = 0; this.querySelectorAll('[data-hover]').forEach((e) => e.style.opacity = 0);\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 260\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Weekly patient satisfaction scores over 10 weeks. This puskesmas rose from 62 to 84; the city average rose from 64 to 75.\">\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"232\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"236\">50</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"177\" y2=\"177\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"181\">60</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"122\" y2=\"122\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"126\">70</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"67\" y2=\"67\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"71\">80</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">90</text>\n      <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"44\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W1</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"139.1\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W2</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"234.2\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W3</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"329.3\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W4</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"424.4\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W5</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"519.6\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W6</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"614.7\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W7</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"709.8\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W8</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"804.9\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W9</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"900\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W10</text>\n      <path class=\"series-area\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45 L900 232 L44 232 Z\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line series-line--2\" d=\"M44 155 L139.1 144 L234.2 138.5 L329.3 133 L424.4 122 L519.6 127.5 L614.7 111 L709.8 105.5 L804.9 100 L900 94.5\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line draw\" pathLength=\"1200\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45\"></path>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-strong);\">Us 84</text>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"98.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-subtle);\">City 75</text>\n      <line data-cross data-hover class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"232\" style=\"opacity: 0; stroke: var(--line-strong);\"></line>\n      <circle data-p2 data-hover r=\"5\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"var(--series-4)\" stroke=\"var(--bg-base)\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></circle>\n      <circle data-p1 data-hover r=\"5\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"var(--series-1)\" stroke=\"var(--bg-base)\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"ctip\" style=\"opacity: 0; left: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"chart-card\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Is our service on par with other puskesmas?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Patient satisfaction score per week, this puskesmas against the city average</div></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-1); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>This puskesmas</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>City average</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; padding-top: 44px;\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 260\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Weekly patient satisfaction scores over 10 weeks. This puskesmas rose from 62 to 84; the city average rose from 64 to 75.\">\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"232\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"236\">50</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"177\" y2=\"177\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"181\">60</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"122\" y2=\"122\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"126\">70</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"67\" y2=\"67\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"71\">80</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">90</text>\n      <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"44\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W1</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"139.1\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W2</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"234.2\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W3</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"329.3\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W4</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"424.4\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W5</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"519.6\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W6</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"614.7\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W7</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"709.8\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W8</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"804.9\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W9</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"900\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W10</text>\n      <path class=\"series-area\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45 L900 232 L44 232 Z\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line series-line--2\" d=\"M44 155 L139.1 144 L234.2 138.5 L329.3 133 L424.4 122 L519.6 127.5 L614.7 111 L709.8 105.5 L804.9 100 L900 94.5\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line draw\" pathLength=\"1200\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45\"></path>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-strong);\">Us 84</text>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"98.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-subtle);\">City 75</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Drawn from data",
        "desc": "Three puskesmas and a dashed minimum standard from one config: lines draw in once, the crosshair reads every puskesmas, arrow keys work on focus, the legend switches puskesmas off, and a hidden table carries every value.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-trio\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"lc-trio\">Which puskesmas is improving fastest?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Average patient satisfaction score per week, out of 100</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Average satisfaction score per week at three puskesmas over 10 weeks. Puskesmas A rose from 61 to 82; B and C ended near 74.\",\"x\":[\"W1\",\"W2\",\"W3\",\"W4\",\"W5\",\"W6\",\"W7\",\"W8\",\"W9\",\"W10\"],\"xFull\":[\"Week 1\",\"Week 2\",\"Week 3\",\"Week 4\",\"Week 5\",\"Week 6\",\"Week 7\",\"Week 8\",\"Week 9\",\"Week 10\"],\"xName\":\"Week\",\"kind\":\"line\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Puskesmas A\",\"values\":[61,64,66,70,71,74,77,78,80,82]},{\"name\":\"Puskesmas B\",\"values\":[66,67,69,68,70,72,71,73,74,74]},{\"name\":\"Puskesmas C\",\"values\":[70,69,71,72,71,73,72,74,73,75]},{\"name\":\"Minimum standard\",\"values\":[65,65,65,65,65,65,65,65,65,65],\"dashed\":true,\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"y\":{\"min\":50,\"max\":90},\"height\":220}'></div></section>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Dua seri dengan crosshair",
        "desc": "Gerakkan kursor di atas plot: crosshair menempel ke minggu terdekat dan tip menampilkan kedua nilainya. Label di ujung garis membuat legenda tidak wajib.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Apakah layanan kita setara dengan puskesmas lain?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Skor kepuasan pasien per minggu, puskesmas ini dibanding rata-rata kota</div></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-1); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>Puskesmas ini</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>Rata-rata kota</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; padding-top: 44px;\" data-pts='[[62,64],[68,66],[65,67],[71,68],[74,70],[70,69],[78,72],[81,73],[79,74],[84,75]]' onmousemove=\"const r = this.getBoundingClientRect(), d = JSON.parse(this.dataset.pts), n = d.length - 1; const i = Math.max(0, Math.min(n, Math.round(((event.clientX - r.left) / r.width * 1000 - 44) / (856 / n)))); const x = 44 + i * 856 / n, y = (v) => 232 - (v - 50) / 40 * 220, s = this.querySelector('svg'); s.querySelector('[data-cross]').setAttribute('x1', x); s.querySelector('[data-cross]').setAttribute('x2', x); s.querySelector('[data-p1]').setAttribute('cx', x); s.querySelector('[data-p1]').setAttribute('cy', y(d[i][0])); s.querySelector('[data-p2]').setAttribute('cx', x); s.querySelector('[data-p2]').setAttribute('cy', y(d[i][1])); s.querySelectorAll('[data-hover]').forEach((e) => e.style.opacity = 1); const t = this.querySelector('.ctip'); t.textContent = 'Minggu ' + (i + 1) + ': puskesmas ini ' + d[i][0] + ', rata-rata kota ' + d[i][1]; t.style.opacity = 1; t.style.left = Math.max(0, Math.min(r.width - t.offsetWidth, x / 1000 * r.width - t.offsetWidth / 2)) + 'px';\" onmouseleave=\"this.querySelector('.ctip').style.opacity = 0; this.querySelectorAll('[data-hover]').forEach((e) => e.style.opacity = 0);\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 260\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Skor kepuasan pasien per minggu selama 10 minggu. Puskesmas ini naik dari 62 ke 84; rata-rata kota naik dari 64 ke 75.\">\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"232\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"236\">50</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"177\" y2=\"177\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"181\">60</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"122\" y2=\"122\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"126\">70</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"67\" y2=\"67\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"71\">80</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">90</text>\n      <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"44\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M1</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"139.1\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M2</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"234.2\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M3</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"329.3\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M4</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"424.4\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M5</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"519.6\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M6</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"614.7\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M7</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"709.8\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M8</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"804.9\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M9</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"900\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M10</text>\n      <path class=\"series-area\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45 L900 232 L44 232 Z\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line series-line--2\" d=\"M44 155 L139.1 144 L234.2 138.5 L329.3 133 L424.4 122 L519.6 127.5 L614.7 111 L709.8 105.5 L804.9 100 L900 94.5\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line draw\" pathLength=\"1200\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45\"></path>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-strong);\">Kami 84</text>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"98.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-subtle);\">Kota 75</text>\n      <line data-cross data-hover class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"232\" style=\"opacity: 0; stroke: var(--line-strong);\"></line>\n      <circle data-p2 data-hover r=\"5\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"var(--series-4)\" stroke=\"var(--bg-base)\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></circle>\n      <circle data-p1 data-hover r=\"5\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"var(--series-1)\" stroke=\"var(--bg-base)\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"ctip\" style=\"opacity: 0; left: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"chart-card\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Apakah layanan kita setara dengan puskesmas lain?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Skor kepuasan pasien per minggu, puskesmas ini dibanding rata-rata kota</div></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-1); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>Puskesmas ini</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4); height: 3px; border-radius: 2px;\"></i>Rata-rata kota</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; padding-top: 44px;\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 260\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Skor kepuasan pasien per minggu selama 10 minggu. Puskesmas ini naik dari 62 ke 84; rata-rata kota naik dari 64 ke 75.\">\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"232\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"236\">50</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"177\" y2=\"177\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"181\">60</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"122\" y2=\"122\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"126\">70</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"67\" y2=\"67\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"71\">80</text>\n      <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"1000\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">90</text>\n      <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"44\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M1</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"139.1\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M2</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"234.2\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M3</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"329.3\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M4</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"424.4\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M5</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"519.6\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M6</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"614.7\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M7</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"709.8\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M8</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"804.9\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M9</text><text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"900\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M10</text>\n      <path class=\"series-area\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45 L900 232 L44 232 Z\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line series-line--2\" d=\"M44 155 L139.1 144 L234.2 138.5 L329.3 133 L424.4 122 L519.6 127.5 L614.7 111 L709.8 105.5 L804.9 100 L900 94.5\"></path>\n      <path class=\"series-line draw\" pathLength=\"1200\" d=\"M44 166 L139.1 133 L234.2 149.5 L329.3 116.5 L424.4 100 L519.6 122 L614.7 78 L709.8 61.5 L804.9 72.5 L900 45\"></path>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-strong);\">Kami 84</text>\n      <text x=\"1000\" y=\"98.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"font: 500 12px var(--font); fill: var(--text-subtle);\">Kota 75</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Digambar dari data",
        "desc": "Tiga puskesmas dan batas minimum putus-putus dari satu config: garis tergambar sekali, crosshair membaca setiap puskesmas, tombol panah berfungsi saat fokus, legenda bisa mematikan puskesmas, dan tabel tersembunyi memuat semua nilai.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-trio\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"lc-trio\">Puskesmas mana yang paling cepat membaik?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Rata-rata skor kepuasan pasien per minggu, dari 100</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Rata-rata skor kepuasan per minggu di tiga puskesmas selama 10 minggu. Puskesmas A naik dari 61 ke 82; B dan C berakhir di sekitar 74.\",\"x\":[\"M1\",\"M2\",\"M3\",\"M4\",\"M5\",\"M6\",\"M7\",\"M8\",\"M9\",\"M10\"],\"xFull\":[\"Minggu 1\",\"Minggu 2\",\"Minggu 3\",\"Minggu 4\",\"Minggu 5\",\"Minggu 6\",\"Minggu 7\",\"Minggu 8\",\"Minggu 9\",\"Minggu 10\"],\"xName\":\"Minggu\",\"kind\":\"line\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Puskesmas A\",\"values\":[61,64,66,70,71,74,77,78,80,82]},{\"name\":\"Puskesmas B\",\"values\":[66,67,69,68,70,72,71,73,74,74]},{\"name\":\"Puskesmas C\",\"values\":[70,69,71,72,71,73,72,74,73,75]},{\"name\":\"Batas minimum\",\"values\":[65,65,65,65,65,65,65,65,65,65],\"dashed\":true,\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"y\":{\"min\":50,\"max\":90},\"height\":220}'></div></section>"
      }
    ]
